      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s so much fun exploring the rooftops, isn’t it?\nAll the different ways the buildings connect!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŗ",
